<title>USA: CarrAmerica buys offices for $296 mln.</title>
<headline>CarrAmerica buys offices for $296 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CarrAmerica Realty Corp said Monday it bought $296 million of suburban office properties in suburban Chicago, Phoenix, Dallas, Southern California and Northern California.  </p>
<p>Including the new purchases, CarrAmerica said it had invested more than $1 billion in 147 suburban properties totaling more than 9.0 million square feet since March, 1996.</p>
<p>CarrAmerica is an owner and operator of value office properties.</p>
</text>
